{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/English.png?t=1742848662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In collaboration with Pompasaur &gt;&gt;&gt; Inspired by Gnarled hag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspired by Gnarled Hag and Granny. You play as a girl who needs to escape from an old dilapidated house where a scary old man lives.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hide from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/GIF_New_01.gif?t=1742848662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide behind boxes, crates, a sofa, look for a way out, but most importantly, don't make noise. Otherwise, he will notice you. You don't want him to catch you, do you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Run from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/GIF_New_02.gif?t=1742848662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can still escape if you have enough strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve riddles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/GIF_New_03.gif?t=1742848662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A big house, many traps and riddles that need to be solved to find a way out of the house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/_GIF_New_04.gif?t=1742848662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you will have to solve it yourself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2111430?t=1742848662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=